              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What Generics Give",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`List<String>` rejects `add(42)` at ==compile time==",
                "`get()` returns `String`: ==no cast== needed",
                "Type arguments are **reference types**: `List<int>` is illegal",
                "Use `List<Integer>`; ==autoboxing== converts int values"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Declaring Type Parameters",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
