          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What Erasure Does",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Compiler checks types, then ==erases== the type arguments",
                "`T` becomes its bound, or `Object`",
                "Casts are {blue:inserted at call sites}",
                "`List<String>` and `List<Integer>` share `List.class`, so `getClass()` is equal"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Bridge Methods",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "compareTo(Object)",
                    "sub": "synthetic bridge",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "casts to String",
                    "sub": "inserted by compiler",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "compareTo(String)",
                    "sub": "your method",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Bridges keep ==overriding== working after erasure"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Heap Pollution",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Raw and generic mixed: `add(42)` enters a `List<String>`",
                "Compiler only gives an ==unchecked== warning",
                "The {red:ClassCastException} comes later, at the inserted cast"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Reified vs Erased",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Arrays",
                "Generics"
              ],
              "rows": [
